{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shouting Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Full Anime and Fight Using Your Voice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast spells by shouting their names<strong> </strong>or chant full incantations to unleash even greater magic.<br>Just like in anime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by a cutting-edge automatic speech recognition (ASR) model, voice casting is fast, accurate, low-latency and support many languages include: English, Japanese, Spanish, Korean, Bahasa Indonesia, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/814486b7e08cabce7381156193703b60.poster.avif?t=1774804042\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/814486b7e08cabce7381156193703b60.webm?t=1774804042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/814486b7e08cabce7381156193703b60.mp4?t=1774804042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Typing Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type Your Incantations Like Your Keyboard Is a Spellbook</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm up your fingers and unleash spells through your typing skill. Prove your fingers are as deadly as any voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/509c5439638b61d4bcac57e4f6e1aea4.poster.avif?t=1774804042\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/509c5439638b61d4bcac57e4f6e1aea4.webm?t=1774804042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/509c5439638b61d4bcac57e4f6e1aea4.mp4?t=1774804042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Button, Pure Skill</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast spells with a single input  but you need to complete the full Quick Time Event (QTE) sequence to cast successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/3cb1c6b1a07320b1004392c4f72c7554.poster.avif?t=1774804042\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/3cb1c6b1a07320b1004392c4f72c7554.webm?t=1774804042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/3cb1c6b1a07320b1004392c4f72c7554.mp4?t=1774804042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Endless Spell Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover more than 25 unique spells. Cast fireballs, teleport across the field, create a barrier, or unleash a powerful ultimate attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your spells by imbuing it with elemental power: burn foes with fire, freeze them with ice, or blind them with darkness. Experiment, combine, and master them to create your own fighting style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duel\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Fight another player in a one-on-one battle to decide who is the strongest spellcaster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Battle</strong> \u2013 Fight as a team, combo your spells, work together to gain victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-for-All</strong> \u2013 Fight with up to 16 players in one big area where danger might comes from every direction in an always changing Arena.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VRoid Character Integration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the battle with your very own character. The game also supports VRoid character integration \u2014 bring in your custom VRoid models and fight as your very own anime avatar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b9c2250866a0cc17eae8b5dacdd8724c.webp?t=1774804042\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b9c2250866a0cc17eae8b5dacdd8724c.poster.avif?t=1774804042\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011300?t=1774804042","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011300?t=1774804042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/c782ecec9fc8eb9be2bf2f5c037e4a4afea02eb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774804042","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/c782ecec9fc8eb9be2bf2f5c037e4a4afea02eb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774804042","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game feature fantasy violence and magical combat effects.\r\nIt also uses an open mic system. You may hear other players\u2019 voices, including possible strong language or swearing.\r\nSome outfits may appear revealing."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shouting Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_par