ght comes from every direction in an always changing Arena.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VRoid Character Integration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the battle with your very own character. The game also supports VRoid character integration \u2014 bring in your custom VRoid models and fight as your very own anime avatar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b9c2250866a0cc17eae8b5dacdd8724c.webp?t=1774804042\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b9c2250866a0cc17eae8b5dacdd8724c.poster.avif?t=1774804042\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p>","developers":["Rezero Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/67a37acf18d234d4b585dd9f81e1385865c3783d/header.jpg?t=1774804042","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4011300/669687391/9655036a43938ff0b2eb02cf156fc779868fabf6/1770605837/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770627660","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4011300/669687391/9655036a43938ff0b2eb02cf156fc779868fabf6/1770605837/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770627660","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4011300/669687391/9655036a43938ff0b2eb02cf156fc779868fabf6/1770605837/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770627660","id":257221738,"name":"Super Shout Showdown - Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257221738/e864fd7c8bc068179ff5050f15491e6b897837d4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770627660"}],"name":"Super Shout Showdown","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"